# Pulled in to validate the BZW parser against real usage, but licensed "Ask
# author to host" (maparchive/maps.json) -- not a grant, so it stays local
# and out of git rather than checked in.
/maps/dw_missilewar3.bzw

# CC BY 4.0, so the license isn't what's holding this one back -- it's 45x
# the size of any other map here and loads 0 obstacles (all mesh/sphere,
# which bzo doesn't read yet). Good to have locally for a large-map test;
# revisit checking it in once mesh support makes it render anything.
/maps/ahs3_Paradise_Valley.bzw

# Any user's /view page or the Operator panel's "Import Remote Map" can
# regenerate one of these from whatever server is at host:port, so there is
# nothing here worth version-controlling -- and no license to check in
# either, since it is a reconstruction of another operator's live world, not
# a mapper's own authored file.
/maps/import-*.bzw

# Claude Code session state: local settings and job scratch files.
.claude/

# Recordings uploaded through the Operator panel, or saved by /record. A raw
# recording's hidden packets hold players' addresses and typed commands, so
# only the bundled sample is tracked (docs/replay.md).
/replays/*
!/replays/hix-robots.rec
